WEBVTT

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:12.210
Here. I'm giving this to you, Chiya!

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:14.710
Syaro...

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.500
Come on! Hurry up, Syaro!

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:27.420
I will rule over this entire town!

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.710
It's not here, either.

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.290
Where did it go?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:46.080
It's something so precious to me...

00:00:48.290 --> 00:00:51.880
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.040
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance

00:00:55.330 --> 00:00:57.710
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:01.380
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.580
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:07.960
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.040
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:13.670
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:20.170
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte 
(Arieru koto yori arienai koto)

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:26.170
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite 
(Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:28.880
Sugar yori cinnamon ga

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:32.750
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.130
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:39.170
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou

00:01:39.170 --> 00:01:42.170
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:44.420
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:48.170
Kuruntto hitomawari hora 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.420
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance 
dance (Dance dance!)

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:55.080
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.670
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?

00:01:57.670 --> 00:02:00.710
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)

00:02:00.710 --> 00:02:04.040
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)

00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:09.960
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto 
tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.170
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:16.290
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:22.830
STUDENT COUNCIL PRESIDENTIAL ELECTION
THE PREZ: 14

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:26.870
CHIYA: 16

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:26.870
And so, after counting the votes, our nominee
for student council president is Chiya Ujimatsu!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.460
Who, me?!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.120
Congrats, Chiya!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:34.420
WHYYYY?!

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:36.130
STUDENT
PRESIDENT

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.420
This is what happens when 
you get too confident.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.130
Cut her some slack, it was a close race.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:40.810
Chiya did a lot of work during the Culture Festival,
remember? Everyone has high hopes for her!

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:43.470
Well, I guess that's true...

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:46.580
Chiya's producer shall be none other than me!

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.080
I'll turn her into the best President ever!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.460
That would make you my First Lady, Cocoa!

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:55.780
I don't think it's a good idea
for those two to come as a set...

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.460
Elections For The Student Council

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.960
I can't believe I was endorsed
for student council president...

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.450
AMA USA AN

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:09.500
Chiya?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.040
Ugh! This isn't getting it across at all!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.500
Trouble naming new items on the menu?
That's unusual for you.

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.630
No, I'm writing a draft of my campaign speech
for student council president.

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:25.970
My class endorsed me for the position.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:28.920
And... you accepted?

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:29.630
Yeah.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.170
Everyone seemed content 
with me as their pick.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.110
I feel like I have to 
answer their expectations.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.610
Student Council Name Change Ideas
Disciplinary Committee
- Watchdogs Of Law & Order

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.630
Cleaning Committee
- Defenders Of The White Castle

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.630
Library Committee 
- Sages Of The Paper Forest
PR Committee

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.790
Wh-what is this...?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.670
Stay focused on your speech!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:46.120
But it's so difficult...

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.330
Oh, hey!

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.460
Maybe changing all the names of the councils
can be my big campaign pledge!

00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:54.250
The only one who'd vote 
just for that is Cocoa...

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:05.330
I wonder if I'd look more like a college student
by wearing my hair down.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:09.710
It's Chiya!

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:21.040
Would this make a decent replacement?

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:23.580
Chiya!

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.620
Help me! I need you to make me an adult!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.000
Huh? You want me...?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.040
Hey, Syaro!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.670
Um, er...

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.710
G-greetings.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.390
You're not going to say
that you don't recognize who this is, right?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.170
I'm being tested!

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.430
Does this help at all?

00:04:53.420 --> 00:04:54.630
Senpai?!

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.710
Took you long enough!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.960
I coordinated her new look!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:03.570
I'm going to be in college soon,
so I wanted to seem more mature.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.460
Plus, a good opportunity to change my look
doesn't come around very often.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.920
Is it too extreme?

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.540
I'm worried nobody will 
recognize me anymore...

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.380
You look stunning! There's only one idiot
who wouldn't recognize you, and that's me!

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.330
Look!

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.580
It's Chiya, Syaro and some 
pretty lady we don't know!

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:21.510
Is this a friend of yours from school?

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:22.210
Huh?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.470
They can't tell it's me...

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:26.590
You must be...!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.920
Miss Roze!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.250
Her?! I'm impressed they still remember.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:34.220
I-it's wonderful to see you again,
Miss Chino and Miss Cocoa.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:38.210
It's been so long!
Um, if you have time, please visit our cafe.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:39.790
You promised you would, remember?

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:42.000
Let's all chat over a cup of coffee!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.860
Certainly, I'd love to.

00:05:44.460 --> 00:05:47.330
Do they really not know it's me?

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:51.750
We'll show her to a good spot!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:52.880
The best in the house!

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.540
E-excuse me...

00:05:55.960 --> 00:06:00.290
If I may be so bold, I would love to wear
your cafe's uniform and try working for the day!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:01.630
Her personality changed?!

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:04.630
What do you think, Chino?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:09.180
Rize is off for today, so having someone
sub in for her would be helpful.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:11.670
Why not just tell them it's you?

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.880
It's their fault for not noticing.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:19.190
I just got through staying at their house,
eating at the same table, and sleeping in the same bed!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.580
We're comrades who have traversed 
the same battlefield!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.070
F-fair point...

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:28.830
They might actually have noticed
and are just teasing me.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.380
Miss Roze, we'd love to have you!

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.500
I do so appreciate it!

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:41.150
I'll infiltrate Rabbit House and then wage
psychological warfare until I know for sure!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:44.630
This'll be a good chance to flex the acting muscles I built
while helping out the theater club!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.540
Come, darlings! Let us partake in a waltz
with the fragrance of coffee!

00:06:48.540 --> 00:06:49.790
Yes, let's!

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.290
I'm worried...

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:58.080
Does it suit me?

00:06:58.380 --> 00:06:59.580
You look wonderful!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.270
It's almost as if you were Rize herself!

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:02.580
I am her.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.420
Say, do you know what CQC is?

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:09.420
Seriously? Is this a test 
because she knows it's me?

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.920
Fine. I'll take on the challenge!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:17.490
It refers to the close-range combat techniques
that trained soldiers use. What about it?

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.030
You pass!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.890
This makes you an official member
of Rabbit House's CQC squad!

00:07:22.890 --> 00:07:25.000
When exactly did that become a thing?!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.080
Hello!

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.510
We came to do some studying!

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.460
Welcome to, uh...

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:33.390
Huh? What's with you Riz-?

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.170
No!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.290
Listen, what's happening is...

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:41.600
That sounds like fun!

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.100
Have you met Miss Roze before?

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:48.250
Um, sh-she's actually a student
in my mother's ballet classes!

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:51.630
A-and she's super good at doing turns!

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.950
Nice cover story!

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:55.210
Actually, th-there's more!

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:58.250
She's a master of ballet kenpo
that lives as a college student by day,

00:07:58.250 --> 00:08:02.130
but is a shadow executioner
who battles evil syndicates by night!

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.080
Now it's gone totally off the rails!

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:04.230
What's "ballet kenpo"?

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.710
I wanna see it!

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.790
I'm afraid doing ballet kenpo here
would destroy your cafe...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:14.380
That's right! Ballet kenpo can only be used
in the pursuit of justice!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.050
Yes! Nice cover!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.630
But I bet she could do some ballet
waitressing for you instead!

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.060
Providing a cover doesn't 
help if it's ridiculous!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:27.060
Excuse me, Miss Roze. Could you bring me a cup
of the special blend and a slice of chocolate cake?

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.750
Miss Aoyama?! When did you get here?!

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.170
I can't blow my cover now!

00:08:36.290 --> 00:08:40.080
Here is your special blend 
and chocolate cake, miss!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.250
Amazing!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.540
For a moment there,
you looked as gallant as Rize always does.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.550
Uh oh!

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:53.130
Miss Roze is actually a protege of mine
who assists with my literary club and food reviews.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.590
Food reviews?! What do you mean by "protege"?

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:59.540
It's okay. After you eat the cake,
just say what's written on here.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:01.630
Uh, right.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:04.500
Here. Say "ah"!

00:09:05.130 --> 00:09:06.040
Ahh...

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:13.570
Wow! Angels have descended into my mouth!
My tongue and brain feel like they're melting!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.540
What did you guys put 
in that chocolate cake?!

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:25.040
My psychological warfare plan is going nowhere.
All I've done is get betrayed by my allies!

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.590
Miss Roze.

00:09:26.590 --> 00:09:27.580
Yes?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.540
Would you mind if joined 
you for some sunbathing?

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:34.330
S-sure, be my guest.

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:42.170
I've gotten hooked on sunbathing lately,
and now I'm in a sunbathing competition with Cocoa.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:48.830
Normally, Rize gets upset with us for it, but lately she's
been taking a lot of time off. I guess she must be busy.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.880
I'm a little sad about that...

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.920
So this is what they do when I'm not around.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.700
Are you managing okay, Roze?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.130
Huh? Oh!

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:07.670
These bags of coffee beans 
sure are heavy, huh?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.290
Who's there?!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:16.490
Jeez, it was just Mr. Takahiro.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.500
Don't spook me like that, Coco- WAH!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:21.790
Sorry, Rize.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.500
You knew?

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.270
Don't take me so lightly!

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:31.380
Look! This is all it takes 
to turn you into Rize!

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:37.170
Sorry. I was sad you guys didn't recognize me,
so I put on this act to see if it was true.

00:10:37.580 --> 00:10:42.540
The new you from today was awesome,
but I like your natural self even more!

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.000
Cocoa...

00:10:46.790 --> 00:10:49.170
Something got in my eyes.

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:53.710
Aw man, she knew all along?

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:58.880
Rize's acting was pretty incredible,
but it turns out she totally fell for Cocoa's ploy.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.630
Those were some serious acting chops!

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:03.210
No way...

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:03.670
Huh?

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:08.750
No way! I can't believe that Rize
was actually Roze the whole time!

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.170
And you all knew?! Right from the start?!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:14.650
Uh, when exactly did you 
figure it out, Cocoa?

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.830
When she pulled out her gun, obviously!

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:20.500
Oh God, I'm the world's biggest idiot!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:25.130
After all the time we've spent together...
after how close we've been...

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.160
Those sound like lyrics from a breakup song.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:30.710
How are you so calm about all this, Chino?!

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:34.170
I can't believe everybody tricked me! Ugh!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.050
Where did Miss Roze go...?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:38.330
She's not up to speed at all?!

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:45.170
There!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.250
I'm so embarrassed! How did I not notice it?!

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.170
Sorry for pulling that prank on you.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:53.130
How do I look now?

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:56.040
Good, like the same old Rize.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.690
I guess I shouldn't force 
myself to be someone else.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.500
But you looked equally as wonderful as Roze.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:06.420
I think it would be totally 
fine if you changed your look.

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.080
O-oh yeah? Thanks!

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.380
Then I guess I'll try it again sometime!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:15.470
But I wonder if you'll have 
trouble recognizing me again?

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:18.580
Nuh-uh. I'll know for sure next time.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:26.480
Hi, Rize, it's been forever!

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:27.750
Mocha?!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.080
I've missed you so much!

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:32.350
Let's reunite with a nice cuddle!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:34.460
Is she playing dead?!

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:37.290
What's all the fus- Mocha?!

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.960
I'm so happy to see you again, Chino!

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.960
Let me go and get Cocoa for y-

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.290
I have a surprise just for you!

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:47.170
Cocoa...

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:48.500
Yes?

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.290
I'm banning you from all snacks
if you pull any more stunts like this!

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.960
Chamomile with a Dash of Jealousy
Bunnisode 9:

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:54.920
No more, we promise...

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.460
AMA USA AN

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:05.250
Ta-dah!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.710
I've finished making your
promotional poster for the election!

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:09.210
CHIYA
UJIMATSU 
CAST YOUR VOTE IN THE
NAME OF SWEETNESS!!

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:12.330
It looks more like an ad
for Ama Usa An than an election poster...

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:12.470
FOR THE BEST IN JAPANESE SWEETS
GO TO AMA USA AN

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.960
Oh gosh, this is so embarrassing!

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:19.130
I also wrote my recommendation letter!
I had Miss Aoyama help me do it.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.670
You basically had her 
write the whole thing...

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:28.330
"The Japanese sweets that she creates are conventional,
yet also have a certain unique quality to them."

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:33.500
"The sweetness of her anko bean paste is delicate
and refined, a flavor that revives memories of home..."

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.250
That's just a food review.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.630
I'm overjoyed to hear it, 
but it makes me blush!

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:38.630
U-um...

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:43.010
I also tried writing my 
own recommendation letter.

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.920
Oh! Give it a read!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:50.720
"She is defined by her kindness and sincerity, and always
takes the responsibilities of her job seriously."

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:56.250
"Seeing her strong work ethic will surely be
a shining example to all students and lead them tow-"

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.960
Stop! No more.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.230
Any more compliments and 
I think I'll explode.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:05.240
Chino! Keep going and come 
up with one for me, too!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:11.240
"She never wakes up on time, refuses to eat her carrots,
and is unable to distinguish different blends of coffee..."

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:14.170
Well, Chino seems to have
the recommendation letter covered.

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.910
Is your speech ready to go?

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:18.790
Actually, I haven't written it yet...

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:23.040
I could write about about the greatness
of Ama Usa An all day.

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.630
But it's so difficult to promote myself...

00:14:26.500 --> 00:14:29.780
A good student council president
has to be more dignified than that!

00:14:29.780 --> 00:14:31.950
You've gotta come off as 
calm, cool and collected!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.380
But how can I do that?

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:36.040
Why don't you try doing 
an impression of Rize?

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:37.000
Huh?!

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:40.960
Every last one of you sorry lot
is just a smoldering ember!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:46.360
But under my leadership, you'll join together to become
a raging flame that rivals those of Hell itself!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:48.540
That was great!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.290
Rise up, fellow students!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:53.960
And follow me as we charge through
the battlefield that is adolescence!

00:14:53.960 --> 00:14:55.910
That is not what I sound like!

00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.920
Here you are, "A Fishtastic Sound
Rumbling Through the Fall Sky"!

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.290
This reminds me, I heard that you also got chosen
as a candidate for student council president.

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.760
Yeah, but I've already...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.800
Is that true?! Why didn't you tell me?!

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.770
I tried to.

00:15:12.770 --> 00:15:15.290
If Syaro became the student council
president at her school...

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.940
STUDENT
PRESIDENT

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.630
I hereby establish a bargain sale system
for the school store!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:21.630
So cool!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.000
I wouldn't do that!

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:25.190
Huh?

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:28.250
If Syaro also becomes 
student council president,

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.790
then I doubt we'll have many chances
to meet up like this anymore.

00:15:30.790 --> 00:15:32.320
Well, like I was trying to say earlier...

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:36.040
I promise that when you have meetings,
we'll come to deliver bread and coffee, okay?

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:39.710
Don't overreact. I haven't 
even been elected yet.

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.750
Exactly, and I've already...

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.580
That's right, you guys!

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.830
Don't turn this into a sob fest!
We'll see each other again, as long as we're alive!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.580
So let's cheer our friends 
on with big smiles!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.470
She's overreacting the most...

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.600
Oh, welcome!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.670
Dearie me, what an adorable little cafe.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:00.750
Chiya, darling. Can you fit a group of 4?

00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:04.380
Of course! Please sit wherever you'd like.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:05.580
Chiya!

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:12.290
Here you are! Thanks for waiting!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:15.570
Order up! Three green 
teas and two fishtastics!

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:19.880
This young madam over here
is celebrating the birth of her fifth great grandchild!

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:21.080
Coming right up!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.710
I'm serving it with extra toppings!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.460
Those two always have such perfect teamwork.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:31.880
We'll be seeing less and less 
of Chiya at work like this.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.590
That's true.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.610
Positively shining!

00:16:36.610 --> 00:16:39.670
Yes, putting gold dust on top 
really makes it extravagant.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:42.250
That's not what I meant. 
I'm talking about you!

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:42.640
Huh?

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:46.500
You look extra radiant 
whenever you're hard at work!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.660
Let's bring that radiance 
with you into the election!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.170
Aim to be like gold dust!

00:16:57.170 --> 00:16:59.080
Yay! A real bar of gold!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:02.500
AMA USA AN

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.550
It's gotten chilly.

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.710
Be sure to warm yourselves 
up after you get home.

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:07.630
What's this?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.540
Going home already?

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.330
Yes. Thanks for having us.

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.920
Alright. Well, take these with you.

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.340
CONGRATS
ON THE ELECTION

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.330
Red and white manju!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:17.920
Granny!

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:22.750
These take me back.
That old geezer always loved our manju.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:25.630
You better eat these up
before his ghost comes to claim 'em.

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.080
Thank you.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:33.380
Chiya! Let's show them how it's done
during the election activities tomorrow!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.040
Right!

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:39.830
Okay, I've got to finish 
that draft of my speech.

00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:43.290
You want more?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.500
You're a real hog, missy. 
Here's another batch for ya.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.750
Th-thank you, Granny.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.790
Oh, take some onions with you, too.

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:52.670
I'll go grab 'em.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.920
Wait a second, Granny!

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:08.540
Here.

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.080
I found it.

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.400
You were looking for it, right?

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.250
You noticed?

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.000
How could I not?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:21.410
You were acting kinda weird.
Plus, Anko wasn't wearing it.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:25.710
B-but I searched every room
and couldn't find it anywhere!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.690
Where was it?

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.420
Your grandma was using it as a hair pin.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.540
What?! I didn't notice at all!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:38.170
After all the time we've spent together...
after how close we've been...!

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.180
You're starting to sound like a breakup song.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:46.540
I'm so relieved it turned up.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:51.440
You gave me this as a symbol of my quest
to become a manager capable of world domination.

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.830
That's not what I gave it to you for.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.210
We're totally wearing these to our
acceptance speeches if we get elected.

00:18:58.210 --> 00:18:59.500
That's too embarrassing!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:00.830
And also...

00:19:01.460 --> 00:19:04.750
I already pulled myself out of the running
for student council president.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:05.500
What?!

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:08.210
Is that because you're too busy with work...?

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:11.670
That's part of it. But it's 
not the only reason...

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.080
F-figure it out for yourself!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.920
Syaro gifted it to us all over again.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.210
We'll be together forever.

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:29.420
You, me, and this crown.

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:34.920
Here.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:36.920
I'm giving this to you, Chiya.

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:39.130
Syaro...

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.380
Thank you!

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:52.040
Come on! Hurry up, Syaro!

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:56.750
Chiya?!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:20:01.510
I will rule over this entire town!

00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:04.630
Did I get it wrong?

00:20:05.330 --> 00:20:10.890
Doesn't this crown mean I'm supposed to take over
the world once I became manager of Ama Usa An?

00:20:10.890 --> 00:20:13.250
Th-that's not it!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.170
I just want to see you looking beautiful
when you're at Ama Usa An.

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:19.380
Really?

00:20:24.670 --> 00:20:28.300
Then let's both become 
beautiful managers together!

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:31.290
Huh? I'm going to be a manager, too?

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:34.750
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.600
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:20:36.600 --> 00:20:40.080
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:43.960
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:47.740
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:51.750
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:55.480
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:59.330
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:03.460
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:09.370
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.120
Yappari...

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:16.880
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:20.660
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:24.660
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai

00:21:24.660 --> 00:21:28.690
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:32.550
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:36.170
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.250
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:43.580
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:50.000
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!

00:21:52.130 --> 00:21:54.040
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:55.540
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.790
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:03.960
AMA USA AN

00:22:04.790 --> 00:22:07.040
Chiya, can I borrow some soy sauce?

00:22:07.040 --> 00:22:08.300
Oh! Hey, Syaro!

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.570
Welcome in!

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:12.180
Is this some kind of celebration?

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:15.360
It's the inauguration party
for our new student council president!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:15.920
Huh?

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:18.630
I-is that so...

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:21.790
Chiya...

00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:26.860
Congratulations on getting elected
as the new pres- wha?

00:22:27.080 --> 00:22:32.740
NEWLY
ELECTED

00:22:27.880 --> 00:22:32.750
Thanks everyone for coming to celebrate my successful
run for student council president!

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:33.790
Bwah?!

00:22:34.170 --> 00:22:35.830
We've been waiting!

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:36.830
Congrats!

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:38.040
Congrats!

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:39.710
I thought Chiya was the one who...

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.370
I dropped out of the race.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:43.000
Huh?

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:45.880
It was the same with this crown.

00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:50.580
I lost sight of something very precious,
even though it was right next to me the whole time.

00:22:51.210 --> 00:22:54.920
I want to keep creating a place
for everyone to gather again next year.

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:58.460
My reason for dropping 
out was mostly the same.

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:03.160
I was sad about the idea
of spending less time with everyone.

00:23:03.160 --> 00:23:05.170
And personally, this is 
the only place where I-

00:23:05.170 --> 00:23:06.080
Wait.

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:09.250
Let's share our answer at 
the same time, on three.

00:23:09.580 --> 00:23:12.070
Okay. 1, 2...!

00:23:12.070 --> 00:23:16.540
"This is the only place where I 
feel that I can really shine!"

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:18.760
Good answer!

00:23:18.760 --> 00:23:20.460
Good answer!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.630
"Childhood friends", "soulmates"...
those words have a nice ring to them.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.890
Same for "comrades-in-arms", no?

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:33.830
What? Are you drunk already?

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:35.970
Bunnisode 10: A Request for 
Backup From a Full Heart

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:35.630
You're always so damn shy.
